  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "坚决力推全面革新  (Backing Complete Format Reform)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Bu Xiaogu finishes explaining double elimination, nervous talent agents and sponsors push back hard—only for Chun Yuqiao to step in and back her proposal without reservation. Listen to their debate first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是我坚决力推的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你不能把节目的规则都改了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚才不是说了吗？全面改革。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就要从基本的规则开始完全革新，否则的话没有意义。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "双败淘汰制是增加了新秀的出镜率，可是明星导师们的戏份也降低了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "咱们艺人上节目是为了增加人气，不能承受被淘汰的风险啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "如果艺人导师们被淘汰了，前期投入的广告全都白费了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这也直接影响到我们艺人的广告收入，我没法对公司交代。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先不管它是不是最终的方案，您怎么能判断它的广告价值就是低的呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "十二歌王原本的模式是经过市场证明的，现在已经被改得面目全非了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是我坚决力推的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the proposal that I am pushing forward with full determination.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你不能把节目的规则都改了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Surely you cannot change all the core rules of the show?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "刚才不是说了吗？全面改革。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did we not just say it? A comprehensive reform.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就要从基本的规则开始完全革新，否则的话没有意义。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then we must innovate from the ground rules up; otherwise reform is meaningless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "双败淘汰制是增加了新秀的出镜率，可是明星导师们的戏份也降低了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Double elimination boosts screen time for newcomers, yet cuts screen time for star mentors.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "咱们艺人上节目是为了增加人气，不能承受被淘汰的风险啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our artists join a show to boost popularity—they cannot risk getting eliminated.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "如果艺人导师们被淘汰了，前期投入的广告全都白费了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If celebrity mentors get knocked out, all the upfront ad spending goes to waste.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "这也直接影响到我们艺人的广告收入，我没法对公司交代。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That directly hits endorsement income for our artists, and I cannot answer to my agency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先不管它是不是最终的方案，您怎么能判断它的广告价值就是低的呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Regardless of whether this is final, how can you assume its commercial value will be low?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "十二歌王原本的模式是经过市场证明的，现在已经被改得面目全非了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The original format of Twelve Singers is market-proven, and now you have changed it beyond recognition.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
